## Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.
##
## Based on:
## https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/master/VisualStudio.gitignore

# ============================================
# User-specific files
# ============================================

*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs

# ============================================
# Mono / Xamarin
# ============================================

mono_crash.*

# ============================================
